{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T15:57:40+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-22T15:57:40+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Zignago Vetro S.p.A.","sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Packaging & Containers","country":"Italy","city":"Fossalta Di Portogruaro","website":"https://zignagovetro.com","employees":2788,"summary":"Zignago Vetro S.p.A., together with its subsidiaries, produces, markets, and sells glass containers in Italy, Europe, and internationally. It offers hollow glass containers for food, beverage, cosmetics, and perfumery; and specialty glass containers for wine, spirit, vinegar, and olive oil. The company is also involved in the promotion of glass containers; processing of raw glass into secondary raw material; marketing and regeneration of glass container moulds; and treatment and recycling of glass. It exports its products. The company was founded in 1950 and is headquartered in Fossalta Di Portogruaro, Italy. Zignago Vetro S.p.A. operates as a subsidiary of Zignago Holding S.p.A.","exchange":"Milan","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"Zignago Vetro S.p.A., avec ses filiales, produit, commercialise et vend des récipients en verre en Italie, en Europe et à l'international. Il propose des récipients en verre creux pour la nourriture, les boissons, les cosmétiques et la parfumerie; et des récipients en verre spécialisés pour le vin, l'alcool, le vinaigre et l'huile d'olive. La société est également impliquée dans la promotion des récipients en verre; le traitement du verre brut en matière première secondaire; la commercialisation et la régénération des moules de récipients en verre; et le traitement et le recyclage du verre."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":572841728,"shares_outstanding":88265288,"trailing_pe":16.224998,"forward_pe":11.905853,"price_to_book":1.6020734,"ev_to_ebitda":9.799,"ev_to_revenue":1.693,"dividend_yiel